  m_Name: Dayone
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Dialogue_SO
  _lines:
  - It was far too late and time for bed
  - You lay down on the bed and quickly drifted off to sleep.
  - 'In the dead of night, a succession of knocks jolted you awake. '
  - You hurried to open the door, yet nobody stood outside
  - 'only a pitch-black handprint marked the doorknob. '
